<BaseLayout
  title="Nicholas Bennett | Bartender & Front of House"
  description="Nicholas Bennett’s introduction, customer-facing experience, and résumé for bartender, front-of-house, and bar-support opportunities in Baltimore."
  noindex
>
  <main id="main-content" class="section-shell py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_0.8fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Baltimore, MD / Restaurant opportunities</p>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Nicholas Bennett</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-xl text-rose">Bartender &amp; front of house</p>
        <p class="mt-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/80">I’m interested in bartender and front-of-house opportunities where I can help guests feel welcome and support a dependable team. I bring customer-facing experience, attention to detail, and a willingness to learn restaurant and bar service from the ground up.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-paper/75">I enjoy cocktails, spirit-free drinks, and welcoming conversation. I’m punctual, comfortable with physically active work, and ready to learn your ordering, payment, and service procedures. I’d be glad to start in front of house or bar support and grow with the team.</p>
        <a href="/resumes/nicholas-bennett-bartender-foh.pdf" class="button-primary mt-7">View bartender / FOH résumé (PDF)</a>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/nicholas-bennett-restaurants.jpg" alt="Nicholas Bennett smiling in a black shirt against a white wall" width="1000" height="1000" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-xs rounded-xl2 border border-white/10" />
    </div>

    <section class="mt-14 max-w-3xl border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
      <h2 class="mb-6 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Past experience</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-paper/80">As a crew member at Trader Joe’s (October 2024–March 2025), I worked with customers in a team-based store environment. Within three weeks of starting, a customer mentioned me by name in a positive Google Maps review.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-paper/80">I also worked on the prepared-foods team at Whole Foods Market in April 2025. From January 2023 through September 2024, I provided more than 4,000 Uber rides, working independently and helping passengers with varied needs and destinations.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-paper/80">My background also includes technical support at Kellogg School of Management, where I helped 300 faculty across six campuses, and software engineering at CyberMaxx. Those roles taught me to listen carefully, learn unfamiliar systems, respond to feedback, and work closely with a team.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 max-w-3xl border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
      <h2 class="mb-5 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Get in touch</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-paper/80">I’d love to hear about your team and how I could contribute.</p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col items-start gap-4"><a href="mailto:nicholasbennett.work@gmail.com" class="text-link break-all">nicholasbennett.work@gmail.com</a><a href="tel:+12244324264" class="text-link">224-432-4264</a></div>
    </section>
  </main>
